# Defensive baseline for the install-sh docker test images.
#
# Docker does NOT honor .gitignore. Without a .dockerignore, the
# entire repo root is sent to the Docker daemon as build context,
# including gitignored secrets (.env, .mcpregistry_*_token, *.token),
# the gitignored DOCS/ vault, and any local credentials. With a
# remote Docker daemon (DOCKER_HOST=tcp://...) or a BuildKit cloud
# builder, that context transits the network even though the
# Dockerfiles only COPY install.sh.
#
# Pattern: deny everything, then re-allow the single file the
# Dockerfiles need. Last-match-wins so * is overridden by !install.sh.

*
!install.sh
